  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard -AR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *lastimado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to hurt\" or \"to injure\" (physically or emotionally) — *me lastimé el tobillo* (I hurt my ankle, with reflexive *lastimarse*), *sus palabras la lastimaron* (his words hurt her)",
    "Reflexive *lastimarse* is very common for injuring oneself: *se lastimó al caer* (he/she got hurt falling)",
    "Related: *lástima* (pity, shame — *¡qué lástima!* = what a shame!), *lastimero/a* (plaintive, pitiful)"
  ],
